{"seq":2,"slug":"gp-applications","title":"应用 (贝叶斯优化)：把不确定性变成决策的燃料","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/gaussian-processes/practice/gp-applications","wordCount":1448,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"应用-贝叶斯优化-把不确定性变成决策的燃料\">应用 (贝叶斯优化)：把不确定性变成决策的燃料</h1><p>前面所有章节都在造工具，这一节讲工具能干什么，尤其是那个让 GP 在工业界经久不衰的杀手级应用——贝叶斯优化。核心洞察一句话：GP 给的后验方差不是装饰，而是「我在哪里最无知」的地图，而最无知的地方往往正是最值得下一步探索的地方。当每次评估都昂贵——调一次大模型超参要烧几千块 GPU 时、做一次材料合成要几天——用不确定性来指挥「下一个测哪里」，就能以最少的评估次数逼近最优。这一节讲贝叶斯优化，也捎带主动学习与克里金这两个同源应用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"贝叶斯优化-昂贵黑盒的全局寻优\">贝叶斯优化：昂贵黑盒的全局寻优</h3><p>设想你要最优化一个黑盒函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：没有梯度、每次求值又慢又贵（超参调优、实验设计、机器人控制参数）。贝叶斯优化的循环是：用已有观测拟合一个 GP 代理模型（surrogate），用它的后验均值和方差构造一个采集函数（acquisition function）来打分每个候选点，选采集函数最大的点去真实评估，把新观测加进 GP，重复。GP 在这里是理想代理，因为它同时给出「这里预计多好」（均值）和「这里有多不确定」（方差），采集函数正是用这两者来平衡利用（去均值高处）与探索（去方差大处）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[已有观测 D] --&gt; B[拟合 GP 代理模型]&#10;    B --&gt; C[后验均值 μ x 与方差 σ x]&#10;    C --&gt; D[构造采集函数 α x]&#10;    D --&gt; E[优化 α: 找下一个候选 x*]&#10;    E --&gt; F[真实评估昂贵函数 f x*]&#10;    F --&gt; G[新观测加入 D]&#10;    G --&gt; B&#10;    E --&gt; H[利用: 去 μ 高的地方]&#10;    E --&gt; I[探索: 去 σ 大的地方]&#10;    H --&gt; D&#10;    I --&gt; D\">graph TD\n    A[已有观测 D] --&gt; B[拟合 GP 代理模型]\n    B --&gt; C[后验均值 μ x 与方差 σ x]\n    C --&gt; D[构造采集函数 α x]\n    D --&gt; E[优化 α: 找下一个候选 x*]\n    E --&gt; F[真实评估昂贵函数 f x*]\n    F --&gt; G[新观测加入 D]\n    G --&gt; B\n    E --&gt; H[利用: 去 μ 高的地方]\n    E --&gt; I[探索: 去 σ 大的地方]\n    H --&gt; D\n    I --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"采集函数-如何权衡探索与利用\">采集函数：如何权衡探索与利用</h2><p>采集函数是把 GP 后验翻译成「下一步价值」的规则，几个主流选择各有性格：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>采集函数</th>\n<th>公式思路</th>\n<th>性格</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>期望改进 EI</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[\\max(0, f(x)-f^+)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>平衡，最常用</td>\n<td>有闭式，默认之选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>置信上界 UCB</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>κ</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu(x) + \\kappa\\,\\sigma(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>探索强度由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 显式调</td>\n<td>理论后悔界漂亮</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>改进概率 PI</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(f(x) &gt; f^+)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0213em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>偏保守、易早熟</td>\n<td>少单独用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汤普森采样</td>\n<td>采一条后验函数取其最优</td>\n<td>天然随机探索</td>\n<td>易并行、易扩展</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>以 UCB 为例，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>κ</mi><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu(x) + \\kappa\\sigma(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">κσ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 直白地把「预计好」和「不确定」加权相加：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 大则偏探索、小则偏利用。EI 则度量「相对当前最好值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f^+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9658em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7713em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的期望进步」，在高斯后验下有闭式，是多数库的默认。这些采集函数最后都要被优化（找 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi></msub><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\arg\\max_x \\alpha(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>），这一步本身是个（便宜的）优化问题，用<a href=\"../../mathematical-optimization/nonlinear-metaheuristic/gradient-newton-methods\">梯度与牛顿法</a>或多起点方法解——注意它和 GP 内部的<a href=\"../kernels/hyperparameter-learning\">超参学习</a>是两层嵌套的优化，别混淆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主动学习-花最少的标注买最多的信息\">主动学习：花最少的标注买最多的信息</h2><p>贝叶斯优化的近亲是主动学习：不是找函数最优，而是想用最少的标注把整个函数学准。策略几乎一样，只是打分规则换成「不确定性最大」（去方差最高处采样）或「信息增益最大」。这里能直接用到<a href=\"../foundations/multivariate-gaussian\">多元高斯基础</a>里那个关键性质——后验方差只依赖采样点的位置、与将观测到的具体数值无关，所以你可以在真正标注之前就规划出一批最有价值的查询点。这在标注昂贵的场景（医学影像、专家评审）非常实用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"克里金-地统计学里的老朋友\">克里金：地统计学里的老朋友</h2><p>GP 回归其实早在机器学习之前就以另一个名字活跃着——地统计学里的克里金（Kriging），用于矿产、气象、污染的空间插值：已知若干钻孔或气象站的测量，估计任意位置的值及其不确定性。克里金的「变异函数」（variogram）本质就是核，「克里金方差」就是 GP 后验方差。认识到这层等价很有用：一是地统计学积累了大量核（变异函数）建模经验可借鉴，二是它提醒我们 GP 在低维空间插值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\!-\\!3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 维地理坐标）是绝对的强项，正好避开了 GP 在高维和大数据上的短板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"2026-年的实践图景\">2026 年的实践图景</h2><p>工程上做贝叶斯优化的默认栈是 BoTorch + Ax（Meta 开源），它把 GP 代理、EI/UCB/qNEI 等采集函数、并行/多目标/带约束优化都封装好了，底层是<a href=\"scalable-gps\">可扩展近似</a>提到的 GPyTorch。典型战场：大模型与神经网络的超参调优（比网格/随机搜索省数倍评估）、AutoML、材料与药物的实验设计闭环、编译器/数据库参数自动调优。一个反复被验证的经验是——当评估次数被限制在几十到几百、且函数相对平滑时，贝叶斯优化几乎总是优于随机搜索；一旦评估变便宜、可以上万次，它的优势就被更简单的方法蚕食，这条边界正是下一节要划的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GP 的后验方差是「无知地图」，贝叶斯优化用它指挥昂贵黑盒的下一步评估，最省评估次数。</li>\n<li>贝叶斯优化循环：GP 代理 → 采集函数打分 → 评估最优候选 → 更新，反复。</li>\n<li>采集函数平衡探索与利用：EI 是默认、UCB 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>κ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\kappa</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span></span></span></span></span> 显式调探索、汤普森采样天然并行。</li>\n<li>主动学习是近亲，靠「方差只依赖位置」的性质提前规划最值得标注的点。</li>\n<li>克里金是 GP 的地统计学别名，提醒 GP 在低维空间插值是强项；2026 首选 BoTorch+Ax。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>让这些应用能上规模的近似：<a href=\"scalable-gps\">可扩展近似</a></li>\n<li>主动学习依赖的方差性质：<a href=\"../foundations/multivariate-gaussian\">多元高斯基础</a></li>\n<li>采集函数优化用到的方法：<a href=\"../../mathematical-optimization/nonlinear-metaheuristic/gradient-newton-methods\">梯度与牛顿法</a></li>\n<li>什么时候别用 GP、换别的：<a href=\"gaussian-processes-in-practice\">落地与边界</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应用 (贝叶斯优化)：把不确定性变成决策的燃料","id":"应用-贝叶斯优化-把不确定性变成决策的燃料"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"贝叶斯优化：昂贵黑盒的全局寻优","id":"贝叶斯优化-昂贵黑盒的全局寻优"},{"level":2,"text":"采集函数：如何权衡探索与利用","id":"采集函数-如何权衡探索与利用"},{"level":2,"text":"主动学习：花最少的标注买最多的信息","id":"主动学习-花最少的标注买最多的信息"},{"level":2,"text":"克里金：地统计学里的老朋友","id":"克里金-地统计学里的老朋友"},{"level":2,"text":"2026 年的实践图景","id":"2026-年的实践图景"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"可扩展近似 (稀疏/诱导点)：跨过 O(n³) 这道坎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/gaussian-processes/practice/scalable-gps"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：什么时候该用 GP，什么时候别碰","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/gaussian-processes/practice/gaussian-processes-in-practice"}}